(1638979, 221571, 35602, '<td valign="top">I love this shot.  Its potential is awesome.  Problems - Color is too yellow, focus is too soft.  Your were probably taking it in a mirror, which I have discovered doesn''t lend itself well to studio environments unless you have great lights.  Still, I would give it a 9 if the problems were cleared up.  As it stands, I have to give it around a 4.</td>', 'I love this shot.  Its potential is awesome.  Problems - Color is too yellow, focus is too soft.  Your were probably taking it in a mirror, which I have discovered doesn''t lend itself well to studio environments unless you have great lights.  Still, I would give it a 9 if the problems were cleared up.  As it stands, I have to give it around a 4.', '2005-08-24 08:14:06.000000', NULL, 1),
