(1639500, 220401, 15711, '<td valign="top">I''d leave off the cross. I like the set up and the rich dark tones of it. Maybe scoot to the left so the gouda isn''t cropped out.  The lighting is nice and I like the glint on the wine glass.</td>', 'I''d leave off the cross. I like the set up and the rich dark tones of it. Maybe scoot to the left so the gouda isn''t cropped out.  The lighting is nice and I like the glint on the wine glass.', '2005-08-24 10:21:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1639507, 222148, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nicely lit. Great use of negatifve space. I wonder if you''ll get the same "bad aim" comment I got. LOL  WOW - I like this very much in its simplicity.  I might''ve put it in a glass with no patternh, but maybe it adds to it.  At this point - I say 8 for sure.</td>', 'Nicely lit. Great use of negatifve space. I wonder if you''ll get the same "bad aim" comment I got. LOL  WOW - I like this very much in its simplicity.  I might''ve put it in a glass with no patternh, but maybe it adds to it.  At this point - I say 8 for sure.', '2005-08-24 10:23:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1639508, 220307, 22922, '<td valign="top">Nice angle and sharpness, but could use more depth, and the reflection of the photographer in both eyes is distracting. It feels like the icecream is not central to the photo, but I like the premise.</td>', 'Nice angle and sharpness, but could use more depth, and the reflection of the photographer in both eyes is distracting. It feels like the icecream is not central to the photo, but I like the premise.', '2005-08-24 10:23:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1639511, 222119, 15711, '<td valign="top">I''d cut the cute and go for the cows in the background. They have such expressive faces and this would have been a great shot without the ceramic figurine.</td>', 'I''d cut the cute and go for the cows in the background. They have such expressive faces and this would have been a great shot without the ceramic figurine.', '2005-08-24 10:24:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1639514, 222049, 15711, '<td valign="top">This''d be great if it were in focus.</td>', 'This''d be great if it were in focus.', '2005-08-24 10:24:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1639516, 221616, 22922, '<td valign="top">Not enough interest. The glass is out of focus and the image is grainy. Seems like a last minute effort. Maybe try to work on your rule of thirds, rather than just centering your subject.</td>', 'Not enough interest. The glass is out of focus and the image is grainy. Seems like a last minute effort. Maybe try to work on your rule of thirds, rather than just centering your subject.', '2005-08-24 10:25:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1639518, 222120, 35804, '<td valign="top">Oh...I love the "chi chi" of this...great lighting, great idea...truly one of the best in the challenge.</td>', 'Oh...I love the "chi chi" of this...great lighting, great idea...truly one of the best in the challenge.', '2005-08-24 10:25:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1639519, 220242, 15711, '<td valign="top">Not sure about those white styrofoam beads, but I love the old bottles and the placement.  What if you''d just used a white background and done it in sepia? It might''ve evoked the same idea without the "fake" additional stuff in the bottle.  Just my take on it.  :~D</td>', 'Not sure about those white styrofoam beads, but I love the old bottles and the placement.  What if you''d just used a white background and done it in sepia? It might''ve evoked the same idea without the "fake" additional stuff in the bottle.  Just my take on it.  :~D', '2005-08-24 10:25:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1639522, 221394, 22922, '<td valign="top">Not enough depth and a bit blown out in the highligts. Sharpness is good, and there''s some texture here, but nothing draws my eye into this image.</td>', 'Not enough depth and a bit blown out in the highligts. Sharpness is good, and there''s some texture here, but nothing draws my eye into this image.', '2005-08-24 10:26:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1639523, 221339, 15711, '<td valign="top">I wish the crop at the top weren''t so tight. The red tag is a nice contrast to her black and white.  Maybe up the greens of the grass as well.</td>', 'I wish the crop at the top weren''t so tight. The red tag is a nice contrast to her black and white.  Maybe up the greens of the grass as well.', '2005-08-24 10:26:34.000000', NULL, 1),
