(1639528, 220949, 15711, '<td valign="top">Interesting placement.  I wish the glass had no wording on it. The kitty''s close up is good. The lighting is well done.  I would have loved to see her/him on a black or white setting. The wood is a tad distracting.</td>', 'Interesting placement.  I wish the glass had no wording on it. The kitty''s close up is good. The lighting is well done.  I would have loved to see her/him on a black or white setting. The wood is a tad distracting.', '2005-08-24 10:27:39.000000', NULL, 1),
