(1639541, 221556, 22922, '<td valign="top">I like the stop-motion capture, but the image as a whole is unprofessional-looking. The background is too defined, especially for a capture of white milk, and the oreos look messy and crumbly, rather than appealing. Perhaps shooting this from another angle or showing just one nice oreo in the shot would pull the image together.</td>', 'I like the stop-motion capture, but the image as a whole is unprofessional-looking. The background is too defined, especially for a capture of white milk, and the oreos look messy and crumbly, rather than appealing. Perhaps shooting this from another angle or showing just one nice oreo in the shot would pull the image together.', '2005-08-24 10:31:29.000000', NULL, 1),
