(1639803, 222055, 15711, '<td valign="top">The yellow tone could be worked on with some selective desat under the white category. Since there is so much variety of color, this might work better as black and white and go for the contrast as well as the linear quality of it.</td>', 'The yellow tone could be worked on with some selective desat under the white category. Since there is so much variety of color, this might work better as black and white and go for the contrast as well as the linear quality of it.', '2005-08-24 11:55:17.000000', NULL, 1),
