(1639843, 222134, 15711, '<td valign="top">CUTE - milk bone. I had to study it a minute. HEE HEE  Very clear image. Maybe the nose is a tad distracting,but I know what you''re going for. Maybe crop out all but just a tad of him, so you see the chin hairs, and the effect would still work, just wouldn''t have any blur in it. Hope you find this helkpful.</td>', 'CUTE - milk bone. I had to study it a minute. HEE HEE  Very clear image. Maybe the nose is a tad distracting,but I know what you''re going for. Maybe crop out all but just a tad of him, so you see the chin hairs, and the effect would still work, just wouldn''t have any blur in it. Hope you find this helkpful.', '2005-08-24 12:01:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1639847, 222069, 31403, '<td valign="top">very dark on my monitor, more light on the cherries and the plate would be nice.  fun splash, hard shot to get!</td>', 'very dark on my monitor, more light on the cherries and the plate would be nice.  fun splash, hard shot to get!', '2005-08-24 12:02:13.000000', NULL, 1),
