(1639850, 221960, 27845, '<td valign="top">Huh? Does milk really react to magnetism? Strange. Good idea, then, but the composition is messed up. A slight tilt and a tightr crop would have made this shot much more dynamic and fresh. 7.</td>', 'Huh? Does milk really react to magnetism? Strange. Good idea, then, but the composition is messed up. A slight tilt and a tightr crop would have made this shot much more dynamic and fresh. 7.', '2005-08-24 12:02:18.000000', NULL, 1),
