(1639866, 221623, 15711, '<td valign="top">I think I woiuld have liked this much better without the grainy filter.  Maybe very stark and sharp black and white would have had more of the advertisement feel I think you were going for.  I like the overall composition - maybe straighten the glass to be parallel with the bottom and top of the photo.  Lovely model.</td>', 'I think I woiuld have liked this much better without the grainy filter.  Maybe very stark and sharp black and white would have had more of the advertisement feel I think you were going for.  I like the overall composition - maybe straighten the glass to be parallel with the bottom and top of the photo.  Lovely model.', '2005-08-24 12:05:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1639868, 219977, 15711, '<td valign="top">I''d have this way to the right  side instead of dead center - a bit more interesting to the eye that way.</td>', 'I''d have this way to the right  side instead of dead center - a bit more interesting to the eye that way.', '2005-08-24 12:05:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1639870, 222069, 36499, '<td valign="top">this photo is way too dark(yes,my monitor is calibrated) and theres alot of noise here. i see why you couldnt use alot of light(tray for cherries) but if u had opened up your apeture( im thinking 2 or lower) would''ve given you enought lighting to see details. excellent composition and i love the splash (excellent capture by the way) if u ever retake this with more light let me know...i would love to see it</td>', 'this photo is way too dark(yes,my monitor is calibrated) and theres alot of noise here. i see why you couldnt use alot of light(tray for cherries) but if u had opened up your apeture( im thinking 2 or lower) would''ve given you enought lighting to see details. excellent composition and i love the splash (excellent capture by the way) if u ever retake this with more light let me know...i would love to see it', '2005-08-24 12:05:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1639873, 222163, 16648, '<td valign="top">way overshparened.</td>', 'way overshparened.', '2005-08-24 12:06:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1639875, 221526, 31403, '<td valign="top">food shots are so hard!  this one seems to have too much green in it?  the shadow on the top almost looks like mold - I admire you trying, you gave yourself a hard task, but this doesn''t look appetizing to me.</td>', 'food shots are so hard!  this one seems to have too much green in it?  the shadow on the top almost looks like mold - I admire you trying, you gave yourself a hard task, but this doesn''t look appetizing to me.', '2005-08-24 12:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1639876, 221741, 15711, '<td valign="top">Beautiful fur on the dog. I think black and white might serve you better as the floor grain is a bit distracting - or to me it is.  Nice idea. I''d have gotten down on the floor so that I''m almost at the same level as the dog''s snout.</td>', 'Beautiful fur on the dog. I think black and white might serve you better as the floor grain is a bit distracting - or to me it is.  Nice idea. I''d have gotten down on the floor so that I''m almost at the same level as the dog''s snout.', '2005-08-24 12:07:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1639878, 222038, 16648, '<td valign="top">a little to dark, as in underexposed.  the sky came out OK, but the cow and grass ared at leat a full stop under.</td>', 'a little to dark, as in underexposed.  the sky came out OK, but the cow and grass ared at leat a full stop under.', '2005-08-24 12:07:19.000000', NULL, 1),
