(1640923, 219683, 3669, '<td valign="top">Twice in a row, pictures came up on the screen not having to do with dairy.  I was beginning to wonder if I was voting in the right challenge.  This picture is beautiful.  The clouds in front of the sun and the bird are very pretty.  Too bad the water was choppy so you could have gotten a nice reflection.  Sadly, this picture is going to be hit hard in voting because of the lack of dairy.  That is too bad because it is such a great capture and deserves more.  I hope to see more of your work in other challenges.</td>', 'Twice in a row, pictures came up on the screen not having to do with dairy.  I was beginning to wonder if I was voting in the right challenge.  This picture is beautiful.  The clouds in front of the sun and the bird are very pretty.  Too bad the water was choppy so you could have gotten a nice reflection.  Sadly, this picture is going to be hit hard in voting because of the lack of dairy.  That is too bad because it is such a great capture and deserves more.  I hope to see more of your work in other challenges.', '2005-08-24 15:46:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1640926, 222022, 37783, '<td valign="top">I love ala mode! nice shot</td>', 'I love ala mode! nice shot', '2005-08-24 15:46:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1640936, 220285, 3669, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture and focus.  The only thing that I see that distracts from this photo, IMO, is the yellow cast.  Would like to see the cream whiter.  8</td>', 'Excellent capture and focus.  The only thing that I see that distracts from this photo, IMO, is the yellow cast.  Would like to see the cream whiter.  8', '2005-08-24 15:49:29.000000', NULL, 1),
