(1640969, 220709, 3669, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture.  Good focus and detail.  However, the yellow hue showing up throughout the picture, especially on the left side of the glass  is rather distracting.  Simply switching to B&amp;W would have done the picture good.  8</td>', 'Excellent capture.  Good focus and detail.  However, the yellow hue showing up throughout the picture, especially on the left side of the glass  is rather distracting.  Simply switching to B&W would have done the picture good.  8', '2005-08-24 15:58:39.000000', NULL, 1),
