(1641074, 221558, 25754, '<td valign="top">whoa! i love the effort put into this and it''s such an original idea. the green eyes are a great contrast against the chocolate. i wish the reflection from your lighting wasn''t so harsh.</td>', 'whoa! i love the effort put into this and it''s such an original idea. the green eyes are a great contrast against the chocolate. i wish the reflection from your lighting wasn''t so harsh.', '2005-08-24 16:29:52.000000', NULL, 1),
