(1641384, 222082, 26316, '<td valign="top">urban milk monument. Great find.  One of the most original photos I''ve seen so far with nice color. Perhaps a tighter crop would have been nice?</td>', 'urban milk monument. Great find.  One of the most original photos I''ve seen so far with nice color. Perhaps a tighter crop would have been nice?', '2005-08-24 17:37:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1641386, 221338, 13749, '<td valign="top">well, if i didn''t know any better this would be a librodo work.. (do i know any better?)</td>', 'well, if i didn''t know any better this would be a librodo work.. (do i know any better?)', '2005-08-24 17:37:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1641387, 220376, 41370, '<td valign="top">Appears out of focus</td>', 'Appears out of focus', '2005-08-24 17:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1641389, 222030, 26316, '<td valign="top">nice take on an old idea.  Too bad the reflections on the jar threads are so distracting.</td>', 'nice take on an old idea.  Too bad the reflections on the jar threads are so distracting.', '2005-08-24 17:38:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1641390, 220836, 40819, '<td valign="top">I gave this image a 9 and not a 10 for one reason; it is by far not original. However it is greatly technically wonderful. I have seen so many splashes on this challenge but this one is so nice in that it captures the blue from the cup so well at the top of the splash. I am sure with the slight delay of the shutter it was not a simply capture. There must have been many takes to get it just right and it is great. So enjoy my Nine.</td>', 'I gave this image a 9 and not a 10 for one reason; it is by far not original. However it is greatly technically wonderful. I have seen so many splashes on this challenge but this one is so nice in that it captures the blue from the cup so well at the top of the splash. I am sure with the slight delay of the shutter it was not a simply capture. There must have been many takes to get it just right and it is great. So enjoy my Nine.', '2005-08-24 17:38:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1641395, 222044, 41370, '<td valign="top">I love Judith</td>', 'I love Judith', '2005-08-24 17:40:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1641396, 221703, 40819, '<td valign="top">What is the object that is supposed to grab my emotion here? I would think it would be the milk on the model''s back leading to the puddle, but alas I am distracted by another bottle which doesn''t even look like a milk bottle and a border which also distracts from the lovely lady. However, I can completely appreciate what skill it took to setup and shoot this shot and over all it still pleases my eye so I give it a 8 for effort. Hey don''t take it personally, you can blast my photos any time you like.<br/> <br/>Mike<br/> <br/>Disclaimer:<br/>Do not let the honesty and frankness of Michael in anyway be construed as negative comments, they are only for the edification of the photographer. Or...If you can''t stand the heat get out of the kitchen. :)</td>', 'What is the object that is supposed to grab my emotion here? I would think it would be the milk on the model''s back leading to the puddle, but alas I am distracted by another bottle which doesn''t even look like a milk bottle and a border which also distracts from the lovely lady. However, I can completely appreciate what skill it took to setup and shoot this shot and over all it still pleases my eye so I give it a 8 for effort. Hey don''t take it personally, you can blast my photos any time you like. Mike Disclaimer:Do not let the honesty and frankness of Michael in anyway be construed as negative comments, they are only for the edification of the photographer. Or...If you can''t stand the heat get out of the kitchen. :)', '2005-08-24 17:40:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1641398, 221999, 41370, '<td valign="top">I get the play on words but I don''t think it fits the challenge.  Call me a purist.</td>', 'I get the play on words but I don''t think it fits the challenge.  Call me a purist.', '2005-08-24 17:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1641399, 221618, 26316, '<td valign="top">nice picture.  Perhaps a little lighting to get the milk its whitest would have been nice. Good luck!</td>', 'nice picture.  Perhaps a little lighting to get the milk its whitest would have been nice. Good luck!', '2005-08-24 17:41:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1641401, 221840, 41370, '<td valign="top">Too small, out of focus and not very interesting</td>', 'Too small, out of focus and not very interesting', '2005-08-24 17:41:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1641402, 222052, 26316, '<td valign="top">nice black and white.  I love the texture of the siding on the barn.</td>', 'nice black and white.  I love the texture of the siding on the barn.', '2005-08-24 17:42:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1641406, 221367, 26316, '<td valign="top">The milk is blue in this photo? a little more light and a faster shutter speed would have really helped this photo alot.  Other then that nice idea. Good luck.</td>', 'The milk is blue in this photo? a little more light and a faster shutter speed would have really helped this photo alot.  Other then that nice idea. Good luck.', '2005-08-24 17:43:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1641418, 220038, 38702, '<td valign="top">Very original!  I like it!</td>', 'Very original!  I like it!', '2005-08-24 17:46:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1641421, 221269, 42507, '<td valign="top">I like the balance between the swirly stem of the glass and the swirly, globby milk. I personally think the white background is a bit much. Perhaps a light grey would have allowed for a bit more contrast between the milk and the background.</td>', 'I like the balance between the swirly stem of the glass and the swirly, globby milk. I personally think the white background is a bit much. Perhaps a light grey would have allowed for a bit more contrast between the milk and the background.', '2005-08-24 17:47:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1641422, 221516, 26316, '<td valign="top">Great focus, texture, color and composition.  Im always a fan of the "through the fence" shots.  Best of luck!</td>', 'Great focus, texture, color and composition.  Im always a fan of the "through the fence" shots.  Best of luck!', '2005-08-24 17:47:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1641432, 222134, 42507, '<td valign="top">Interesting viewpoint, but the subject gets lost because of the dog''s head. It makes the photo feel a bit unbalanced.</td>', 'Interesting viewpoint, but the subject gets lost because of the dog''s head. It makes the photo feel a bit unbalanced.', '2005-08-24 17:49:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1641437, 220271, 42507, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photograph. It should be featured in a food magazine. The sharpness of the image is right where it should be; my eye immediately goes to the cheese, then the grapes, and then through the rest of the photo.</td>', 'Beautiful photograph. It should be featured in a food magazine. The sharpness of the image is right where it should be; my eye immediately goes to the cheese, then the grapes, and then through the rest of the photo.', '2005-08-24 17:50:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1641440, 220843, 38941, '<td valign="top">visually interesting</td>', 'visually interesting', '2005-08-24 17:51:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1641442, 221619, 26316, '<td valign="top">wow cool shot.  I''ve done that a few times (not properly attached lid) but its cool to see it freez-framed.   Good luck!</td>', 'wow cool shot.  I''ve done that a few times (not properly attached lid) but its cool to see it freez-framed.   Good luck!', '2005-08-24 17:51:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1641443, 219972, 42507, '<td valign="top">The photo is a little too dark and I find myself wanting to push the milk out of the way so I can see what lies behind. Pointing the camera down so the bottom of the milk jug is visible would help ground the photo and would help the viewer feel comfortable with it being the main subject of the photo.</td>', 'The photo is a little too dark and I find myself wanting to push the milk out of the way so I can see what lies behind. Pointing the camera down so the bottom of the milk jug is visible would help ground the photo and would help the viewer feel comfortable with it being the main subject of the photo.', '2005-08-24 17:52:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1641448, 222053, 42507, '<td valign="top">The background makes this photo seem a bit "snapshot-ish" and flattens the subject. A background color that contrasts with her flesh would be more preferable; the same goes for the bit of ice cream.</td>', 'The background makes this photo seem a bit "snapshot-ish" and flattens the subject. A background color that contrasts with her flesh would be more preferable; the same goes for the bit of ice cream.', '2005-08-24 17:53:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1641450, 221849, 42507, '<td valign="top">A truly interesting photo! The composition is great; the milk bone isn''t too close to either edge. The contrast is great and the range of blacks, greys and white is full.</td>', 'A truly interesting photo! The composition is great; the milk bone isn''t too close to either edge. The contrast is great and the range of blacks, greys and white is full.', '2005-08-24 17:55:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1641452, 220697, 42507, '<td valign="top">Very dynamic. How did you make the swirly pattern in the background? It adds a tremendous amount of drama and interest. Great idea with the upside-down wine glass.</td>', 'Very dynamic. How did you make the swirly pattern in the background? It adds a tremendous amount of drama and interest. Great idea with the upside-down wine glass.', '2005-08-24 17:56:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1641457, 221925, 42507, '<td valign="top">Great shot. The photo is a little grainy and a smidge out of focus, though. Still, it would be a great photo to hang above my coffee shrine in my kitchen.</td>', 'Great shot. The photo is a little grainy and a smidge out of focus, though. Still, it would be a great photo to hang above my coffee shrine in my kitchen.', '2005-08-24 17:58:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1641462, 221421, 26316, '<td valign="top">cool texture. Nice contrast. Excellent depth of focus.  I like it !</td>', 'cool texture. Nice contrast. Excellent depth of focus.  I like it !', '2005-08-24 17:59:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1641463, 221043, 42507, '<td valign="top">I love the composition. It''s close, personal, and humorous. There''s not enough contrast between the ice cream and the child''s face, though. It all becomes one mass of white.</td>', 'I love the composition. It''s close, personal, and humorous. There''s not enough contrast between the ice cream and the child''s face, though. It all becomes one mass of white.', '2005-08-24 17:59:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1641466, 220021, 26316, '<td valign="top">This seems a little out of focus and grainy to me.  I apologize if this is on purpose. I do like the frozen drip of melting icecream though.</td>', 'This seems a little out of focus and grainy to me.  I apologize if this is on purpose. I do like the frozen drip of melting icecream though.', '2005-08-24 18:00:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1641467, 222034, 42507, '<td valign="top">Sure, I''ll take the cone! The viewpoint makes me want to reach in a grab the cone. Wonderful composition and focus.</td>', 'Sure, I''ll take the cone! The viewpoint makes me want to reach in a grab the cone. Wonderful composition and focus.', '2005-08-24 18:00:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1641470, 222091, 41701, '<td valign="top">Wow!</td>', 'Wow!', '2005-08-24 18:01:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1641472, 220836, 26316, '<td valign="top">milk seems a little watery in this photo.  It might be my monitor as im at work. I love the "twisting tendrils" of milk though. Nice capture.</td>', 'milk seems a little watery in this photo.  It might be my monitor as im at work. I love the "twisting tendrils" of milk though. Nice capture.', '2005-08-24 18:02:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1641474, 222147, 42507, '<td valign="top">So soothing, and yet, so sterile. The photo is cold but clean and serene. Even though it''s a very high key photo there is still wonderful contrast between the milk and the background. Neither one flows into the other.</td>', 'So soothing, and yet, so sterile. The photo is cold but clean and serene. Even though it''s a very high key photo there is still wonderful contrast between the milk and the background. Neither one flows into the other.', '2005-08-24 18:02:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1641476, 221896, 38702, '<td valign="top">Would have been neat if your hand wasn''t there, however, that is a bit tough to get a cone to stand on it''s own.  Good pic good colors.</td>', 'Would have been neat if your hand wasn''t there, however, that is a bit tough to get a cone to stand on it''s own.  Good pic good colors.', '2005-08-24 18:02:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1641477, 222036, 811, '<td valign="top">Too funny.  Not crazy about the left tilt, but an interesting shot!</td>', 'Too funny.  Not crazy about the left tilt, but an interesting shot!', '2005-08-24 18:03:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1641478, 220368, 26316, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting. good compostion. sharp focus.   A favorite for this challenge. Nice work !</td>', 'Nice lighting. good compostion. sharp focus.   A favorite for this challenge. Nice work !', '2005-08-24 18:03:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1641480, 220409, 811, '<td valign="top">Good stop action, a bit grainy to me, though.</td>', 'Good stop action, a bit grainy to me, though.', '2005-08-24 18:03:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1641481, 220401, 42507, '<td valign="top">Wonderful detail and texture throughout the photo. The composition is pretty good although the camera could be moved just an inch or so to the left to balance it out.</td>', 'Wonderful detail and texture throughout the photo. The composition is pretty good although the camera could be moved just an inch or so to the left to balance it out.', '2005-08-24 18:04:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1641483, 220543, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the composition.  The white on the carons/jugs seems a bit blown out to me (monitor usually looks too dark).</td>', 'I like the composition.  The white on the carons/jugs seems a bit blown out to me (monitor usually looks too dark).', '2005-08-24 18:04:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1641485, 222110, 38702, '<td valign="top">Cool!</td>', 'Cool!', '2005-08-24 18:05:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1641486, 221730, 811, '<td valign="top">Nice landscape</td>', 'Nice landscape', '2005-08-24 18:05:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1641487, 222091, 42507, '<td valign="top">Wonderful effect, great focus, perfect contrast and range of greys and impecable composition.</td>', 'Wonderful effect, great focus, perfect contrast and range of greys and impecable composition.', '2005-08-24 18:05:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1641490, 221768, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the bw and leading lines in this.</td>', 'I like the bw and leading lines in this.', '2005-08-24 18:05:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1641494, 222150, 42507, '<td valign="top">This photo may have been more effective in color. There is not enough contrast and the top right corner has no detail at all. The background becomes the foreground and the image is flattened.</td>', 'This photo may have been more effective in color. There is not enough contrast and the top right corner has no detail at all. The background becomes the foreground and the image is flattened.', '2005-08-24 18:06:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1641497, 221781, 811, '<td valign="top">Scary, two of those women look familiar!  <br/> <br/>Interesting shot</td>', 'Scary, two of those women look familiar!   Interesting shot', '2005-08-24 18:07:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1641499, 221623, 811, '<td valign="top">Bit grainy, but it gives it a feeling of being a 70ish ad.  I think it might work. :)</td>', 'Bit grainy, but it gives it a feeling of being a 70ish ad.  I think it might work. :)', '2005-08-24 18:08:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1641505, 221389, 42507, '<td valign="top">A great advertisement for Oreo. Contrast is low between the milk, the plate and the background, but the top of the glass gives some balance to the cookies.</td>', 'A great advertisement for Oreo. Contrast is low between the milk, the plate and the background, but the top of the glass gives some balance to the cookies.', '2005-08-24 18:08:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1641507, 220511, 26316, '<td valign="top">You took this style of shot to the next level, and you made your milk the whitest. Congrats a on a great shot. Even the texture of the cookie looks great.</td>', 'You took this style of shot to the next level, and you made your milk the whitest. Congrats a on a great shot. Even the texture of the cookie looks great.', '2005-08-24 18:09:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1641510, 221081, 26316, '<td valign="top">You just man Jerry of Tom and Jerry right?  Great idea.  Noone so far that I''ve commented on has had anything remotely this original.   Nice submission.</td>', 'You just man Jerry of Tom and Jerry right?  Great idea.  Noone so far that I''ve commented on has had anything remotely this original.   Nice submission.', '2005-08-24 18:10:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1641511, 219207, 42507, '<td valign="top">Using a different background would have made the photo more effective. As it is, my attention is drawn to the work going on behind the tower, instead of to the yogurt itself. Very interesting choosing a different type of yogurt for the very top, though.</td>', 'Using a different background would have made the photo more effective. As it is, my attention is drawn to the work going on behind the tower, instead of to the yogurt itself. Very interesting choosing a different type of yogurt for the very top, though.', '2005-08-24 18:10:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1641514, 221005, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the general composition, but the cow in the middle makes it feel static-y.</td>', 'I like the general composition, but the cow in the middle makes it feel static-y.', '2005-08-24 18:10:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1641515, 221999, 26316, '<td valign="top">nice post-erior.   Good play on words and a nicely composed and exposed shot.</td>', 'nice post-erior.   Good play on words and a nicely composed and exposed shot.', '2005-08-24 18:10:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1641524, 221924, 42507, '<td valign="top">This is a very interesting photograph. I am very curious about it, mainly because of the patterns on the legs and feet. And why are the toes being dipped in the milk? The composition is balanced, though I would like to see a little more contrast between the milk and the background.</td>', 'This is a very interesting photograph. I am very curious about it, mainly because of the patterns on the legs and feet. And why are the toes being dipped in the milk? The composition is balanced, though I would like to see a little more contrast between the milk and the background.', '2005-08-24 18:12:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1641525, 222148, 811, '<td valign="top">Interesting lighting; I like the composition</td>', 'Interesting lighting; I like the composition', '2005-08-24 18:12:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1641527, 222016, 42507, '<td valign="top">Her eyes seem to be saying "Come to me and I will satisfy you." What a seductive cow! Great composition; balanced and interesting. Wonderful detail and focus on the cow.</td>', 'Her eyes seem to be saying "Come to me and I will satisfy you." What a seductive cow! Great composition; balanced and interesting. Wonderful detail and focus on the cow.', '2005-08-24 18:13:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1641528, 221513, 26316, '<td valign="top">what a pour excuse for a shot!   If only the lighting were a little better and the milk had a whiter color.  I like the idea and composition though.  Nice submission.</td>', 'what a pour excuse for a shot!   If only the lighting were a little better and the milk had a whiter color.  I like the idea and composition though.  Nice submission.', '2005-08-24 18:13:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1641529, 221703, 39974, '<td valign="top">fantastic. a real winner. cand get enough.</td>', 'fantastic. a real winner. cand get enough.', '2005-08-24 18:13:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1641531, 221896, 811, '<td valign="top">Good composition and focus.  There seems to be a bit too much red in the colors.</td>', 'Good composition and focus.  There seems to be a bit too much red in the colors.', '2005-08-24 18:14:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1641532, 221840, 26316, '<td valign="top">mmm milk bricks.... hehe.  Interesting idea for a shot. I think your the first I''ve seen with actuall frozen milk.  Good luck!</td>', 'mmm milk bricks.... hehe.  Interesting idea for a shot. I think your the first I''ve seen with actuall frozen milk.  Good luck!', '2005-08-24 18:14:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1641537, 222110, 26316, '<td valign="top">Beauiful shot. Nice leading lines. Perfect whites....  good blured background.  I would say a high finisher in this challenge. You get a 10 from me.</td>', 'Beauiful shot. Nice leading lines. Perfect whites....  good blured background.  I would say a high finisher in this challenge. You get a 10 from me.', '2005-08-24 18:15:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1641539, 221623, 42507, '<td valign="top">Great ad for the Dairy Council! The contrast of the bright white milk against the darker jeans and skin creat balance and interest. Although the photo is a little grainy, it''s a great shot.</td>', 'Great ad for the Dairy Council! The contrast of the bright white milk against the darker jeans and skin creat balance and interest. Although the photo is a little grainy, it''s a great shot.', '2005-08-24 18:15:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1641540, 221513, 41370, '<td valign="top">For me the lighting is bad and seems out of focus</td>', 'For me the lighting is bad and seems out of focus', '2005-08-24 18:15:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1641541, 221264, 42507, '<td valign="top">This is nothing but an excuse to take pictures of naked women.</td>', 'This is nothing but an excuse to take pictures of naked women.', '2005-08-24 18:15:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1641544, 219987, 26316, '<td valign="top">nice shot. Perhaps a shot from a little further would have  been nice.  I think the trap needs to be emphasized more.   Great idea for the challenge though. Good luck !</td>', 'nice shot. Perhaps a shot from a little further would have  been nice.  I think the trap needs to be emphasized more.   Great idea for the challenge though. Good luck !', '2005-08-24 18:16:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1641546, 222079, 41370, '<td valign="top">The lighting is off for me.</td>', 'The lighting is off for me.', '2005-08-24 18:17:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1641549, 222162, 42507, '<td valign="top">This is a very cute picture. The composition is balanced, contrast is good and the subject gives a warm and fuzzy feeling despite the snowflaked background. My only recommendation for this photo is to make the bottom edge a little less bright. It distracts the eye from the subject.</td>', 'This is a very cute picture. The composition is balanced, contrast is good and the subject gives a warm and fuzzy feeling despite the snowflaked background. My only recommendation for this photo is to make the bottom edge a little less bright. It distracts the eye from the subject.', '2005-08-24 18:17:41.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1641551, 219699, 41370, '<td valign="top">As far as I can tell this doen''t meet the challenge</td>', 'As far as I can tell this doen''t meet the challenge', '2005-08-24 18:18:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1641552, 222011, 41370, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t meet the challenge</td>', 'Doesn''t meet the challenge', '2005-08-24 18:18:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1641556, 221558, 26316, '<td valign="top">amazing texture on this one.  Not too many people have worked the dairy milk chocolate angle. The green eyes really spice up the image as well. Nice work.</td>', 'amazing texture on this one.  Not too many people have worked the dairy milk chocolate angle. The green eyes really spice up the image as well. Nice work.', '2005-08-24 18:19:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1641558, 220307, 42507, '<td valign="top">She seems to be adoring whoever it is who bought her the ice cream, and the viewpoint makes it seem as though I bought it for her. It makes me happy to think I did something nice for a kid. As for technical aspects of the photo, everything has been done very well. Composition, contrast, detail, focus, interest. It''s all there.</td>', 'She seems to be adoring whoever it is who bought her the ice cream, and the viewpoint makes it seem as though I bought it for her. It makes me happy to think I did something nice for a kid. As for technical aspects of the photo, everything has been done very well. Composition, contrast, detail, focus, interest. It''s all there.', '2005-08-24 18:19:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1641559, 222062, 41370, '<td valign="top">Too bright and focus seems off or overprocessed?</td>', 'Too bright and focus seems off or overprocessed?', '2005-08-24 18:19:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1641560, 221914, 41370, '<td valign="top">This is a pretty cow.</td>', 'This is a pretty cow.', '2005-08-24 18:19:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1641565, 222019, 42507, '<td valign="top">Thank you for using a black background for the milk. Everyone else seems to want to hide the milk in a white background. It does seem a little too "staged," though; spilled milk is an accident and doesn''t ever look as neat as this photo.</td>', 'Thank you for using a black background for the milk. Everyone else seems to want to hide the milk in a white background. It does seem a little too "staged," though; spilled milk is an accident and doesn''t ever look as neat as this photo.', '2005-08-24 18:20:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1641566, 222133, 41370, '<td valign="top">Seems out of focus</td>', 'Seems out of focus', '2005-08-24 18:20:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1641573, 222170, 26316, '<td valign="top">nice lighting, cute girl.  Looks like she is sitting in front of a fireplace.  Beautiful image.</td>', 'nice lighting, cute girl.  Looks like she is sitting in front of a fireplace.  Beautiful image.', '2005-08-24 18:22:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1641576, 222169, 41370, '<td valign="top">I like this photo.  The focus seems just slightly off.</td>', 'I like this photo.  The focus seems just slightly off.', '2005-08-24 18:22:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1641579, 222089, 811, '<td valign="top">Somedays are just like that . . .<br/> <br/>Good composition.  Well balanced.</td>', 'Somedays are just like that . . . Good composition.  Well balanced.', '2005-08-24 18:23:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1641583, 221924, 26316, '<td valign="top">Nice color on this image. I like the composition although I don''t really get the idea.  Excellent submission!</td>', 'Nice color on this image. I like the composition although I don''t really get the idea.  Excellent submission!', '2005-08-24 18:24:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1641584, 220732, 41370, '<td valign="top">IMHO it doesn''t meet the challenge</td>', 'IMHO it doesn''t meet the challenge', '2005-08-24 18:24:40.000000', NULL, 1),
