(1643590, 222048, 21216, '<td valign="top">Maybe one of the best cow pics that I''ve found in this challenge. It''s humourous, fun and tehnically a great shot as well. The colours are great, the matt green of the grass and yet the saturated browns of the cows create a great contrast. And of course what produces the best effect is the wide angle, and you''ve managed to successfully focus on the cow''s eyes...hm... Did he lick your camera? :P The only advice I could have given you was either to somehow avoid the ranch in the far right, or to just crop it off in photoshop, but if you don''t want to loose the balance by cutting that cow''s butt, then well you can just clone it out after the challenge.</td>', 'Maybe one of the best cow pics that I''ve found in this challenge. It''s humourous, fun and tehnically a great shot as well. The colours are great, the matt green of the grass and yet the saturated browns of the cows create a great contrast. And of course what produces the best effect is the wide angle, and you''ve managed to successfully focus on the cow''s eyes...hm... Did he lick your camera? :P The only advice I could have given you was either to somehow avoid the ranch in the far right, or to just crop it off in photoshop, but if you don''t want to loose the balance by cutting that cow''s butt, then well you can just clone it out after the challenge.', '2005-08-25 04:51:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1643609, 221721, 25209, '<td valign="top">Not sure how this relates to challenge.</td>', 'Not sure how this relates to challenge.', '2005-08-25 05:44:30.000000', NULL, 1),
