(1644627, 219544, 34906, '<td valign="top">Great humor and whimsy.  I wish the image in the foreground had been isolated against a black background.  It would have been even more appealing for me.</td>', 'Great humor and whimsy.  I wish the image in the foreground had been isolated against a black background.  It would have been even more appealing for me.', '2005-08-25 14:45:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1644628, 220307, 40718, '<td valign="top">I love his eyes and the contrast of his skin tone with the ice cream (which is, unfortunately, a little blown on highlights).  I would have either wiped the smudges off his nose or gone even more with them, the intent is not clear with this amount.  I''m giving you an 7.  (PS, is that a hot pixel in the upper right?  I''m not holding it against you though...)</td>', 'I love his eyes and the contrast of his skin tone with the ice cream (which is, unfortunately, a little blown on highlights).  I would have either wiped the smudges off his nose or gone even more with them, the intent is not clear with this amount.  I''m giving you an 7.  (PS, is that a hot pixel in the upper right?  I''m not holding it against you though...)', '2005-08-25 14:45:16.000000', NULL, 1),
