(1644640, 221264, 40718, '<td valign="top">man, two naked shots in a row.  Either these are self-portraits or you have an exhibitionist on your hands.  I do like the original idea though and the capture of the milk is nice.  This pose is actually nicer than the last one.  I''m not sure about your expression, you should either be enjoying it or not, this is neutral. 7.<br/> <br/>OK, I forgot I''m supposed to add a point for nipples...so I''m bumping to an 8.</td>', 'man, two naked shots in a row.  Either these are self-portraits or you have an exhibitionist on your hands.  I do like the original idea though and the capture of the milk is nice.  This pose is actually nicer than the last one.  I''m not sure about your expression, you should either be enjoying it or not, this is neutral. 7. OK, I forgot I''m supposed to add a point for nipples...so I''m bumping to an 8.', '2005-08-25 14:48:28.000000', NULL, 1),
