(1644682, 222063, 40819, '<td valign="top">You know there are so many technically wonderful photos in this challenge. However, if you look at my not so perfect entry you will see something I see here, originality. There are just so many ways to splash mike with cookies and strawberry''s but that doesn''t move me as this photo. <br/> <br/>This photo moves me deeply as it depicts life from life. A child depending on the mother at a visceral level which is unmatched on any other plane. This is worth more then gold on both parts, the love the mother is giving her child and the comfort the child displays in it''s eyes.<br/> <br/>Technically the shine in the child''s eyes is wonderful. The fact it is in black and white adds to the simplicity of this life altering experience for the child. And that cute Little nose.<br/> <br/>Well I usually only give one or two 10''s out, this time it is going to be only one 10, this one. Be well and thanks for sharing this with us.</td>', 'You know there are so many technically wonderful photos in this challenge. However, if you look at my not so perfect entry you will see something I see here, originality. There are just so many ways to splash mike with cookies and strawberry''s but that doesn''t move me as this photo.  This photo moves me deeply as it depicts life from life. A child depending on the mother at a visceral level which is unmatched on any other plane. This is worth more then gold on both parts, the love the mother is giving her child and the comfort the child displays in it''s eyes. Technically the shine in the child''s eyes is wonderful. The fact it is in black and white adds to the simplicity of this life altering experience for the child. And that cute Little nose. Well I usually only give one or two 10''s out, this time it is going to be only one 10, this one. Be well and thanks for sharing this with us.', '2005-08-25 15:03:28.000000', NULL, 1),
