(1644922, 221576, 22922, '<td valign="top">An ok photo, but not very interesting. also unclear why you used the swizzle stick, it doesn''t seem like you were swirling the milk, and the stick leaving the frame makes the composition look odd. A nice, clean shot, though.</td>', 'An ok photo, but not very interesting. also unclear why you used the swizzle stick, it doesn''t seem like you were swirling the milk, and the stick leaving the frame makes the composition look odd. A nice, clean shot, though.', '2005-08-25 16:35:05.000000', NULL, 1),
