(1644924, 219972, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity of the shot. I''m not a technical person, but the only thing I noticed is the cap of the bottle is just about even with the horizon. I wonder what effect it would have had if the cap was either a bit above or below?</td>', 'I like the simplicity of the shot. I''m not a technical person, but the only thing I noticed is the cap of the bottle is just about even with the horizon. I wonder what effect it would have had if the cap was either a bit above or below?', '2005-08-25 16:35:23.000000', NULL, 1),
