(1644937, 221721, 37719, '<td valign="top">I''m confused...this was entered into a Dairy challenge, why?  Am I missing something?</td>', 'I''m confused...this was entered into a Dairy challenge, why?  Am I missing something?', '2005-08-25 16:37:59.000000', NULL, 1),
