(1644958, 220384, 22922, '<td valign="top">Nice color and texture, a pleasant change from white, white, and more white. Looks better on LCD than CRT, might check that. Good capture of the "depth" of a flat object. Makes me hungry...</td>', 'Nice color and texture, a pleasant change from white, white, and more white. Looks better on LCD than CRT, might check that. Good capture of the "depth" of a flat object. Makes me hungry...', '2005-08-25 16:44:58.000000', NULL, 1),
