(1644976, 221633, 42627, '<td valign="top">pretty good, except I can see the black towel holding the milk. I really like the reflection of the butter.</td>', 'pretty good, except I can see the black towel holding the milk. I really like the reflection of the butter.', '2005-08-25 16:50:21.000000', NULL, 1),
