(1644985, 221741, 27489, '<td valign="top">Is it what I think it is? A BOXER!! I love him!! Ours has the same coloring!</td>', 'Is it what I think it is? A BOXER!! I love him!! Ours has the same coloring!', '2005-08-25 16:53:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1644987, 221744, 25655, '<td valign="top">this is a brilliant idea in this challenge. So many emotions and thoughts are brough up by those hands.<br/>This could be such a wonderful motivating poster. It has something in it to everyone.<br/> <br/>If there was anything I would consider to change in this shot, it was maybe having those hands from the top left and towards the viewer. not from the viewer and to elsewhere.<br/>But I could be wrong. Hard to visualise it in 2d.<br/> <br/>Anyway I love the familiar process and I think this is one of the top shots of this challenge. Worth the boredom of seeing 60 cows just to get my vote for it to count.<br/> <br/></td>', 'this is a brilliant idea in this challenge. So many emotions and thoughts are brough up by those hands.This could be such a wonderful motivating poster. It has something in it to everyone. If there was anything I would consider to change in this shot, it was maybe having those hands from the top left and towards the viewer. not from the viewer and to elsewhere.But I could be wrong. Hard to visualise it in 2d. Anyway I love the familiar process and I think this is one of the top shots of this challenge. Worth the boredom of seeing 60 cows just to get my vote for it to count. ', '2005-08-25 16:54:31.000000', NULL, 1),
