(1645169, 222169, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Like this, like the frame, like the colors, like the ''style''.  For me, even though the first thing I see is not ''milk/etc'', my eye gets drawn there fast enough.  Criticism; maybe, (though likely impossible seeing as the left top black background is likely ''wall'') would like to see how this would have looked with the cat ''symmetried'' over the top left black ''corner'' (ie; diagonal).  Otherwise, somehow more definition on the ''lapping'' of the milk, and also on the white whiskers that are against the black right foreground.</td>', '8 - Like this, like the frame, like the colors, like the ''style''.  For me, even though the first thing I see is not ''milk/etc'', my eye gets drawn there fast enough.  Criticism; maybe, (though likely impossible seeing as the left top black background is likely ''wall'') would like to see how this would have looked with the cat ''symmetried'' over the top left black ''corner'' (ie; diagonal).  Otherwise, somehow more definition on the ''lapping'' of the milk, and also on the white whiskers that are against the black right foreground.', '2005-08-25 18:16:54.000000', NULL, 1),
