(1645279, 221925, 32239, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot.  I''m surprised I didn''t see more coffee with milk/cream shots.  This is the first! <br/> <br/>Really like the crop and it appears to be clear and sharp.  However, I don''t find the b/w works here.  I find b/w works best when there''s just too many colours for a simple photo.  Here you only have the colour of the table, the white cup and black coffee.  I think the contrast of the coffe and milk would have given this shot an extra "punch".</td>', 'Awesome shot.  I''m surprised I didn''t see more coffee with milk/cream shots.  This is the first!  Really like the crop and it appears to be clear and sharp.  However, I don''t find the b/w works here.  I find b/w works best when there''s just too many colours for a simple photo.  Here you only have the colour of the table, the white cup and black coffee.  I think the contrast of the coffe and milk would have given this shot an extra "punch".', '2005-08-25 19:02:20.000000', NULL, 1),
