(1645434, 222157, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - I like this shot and the ''clean'' and ''sharp feel'' and the style.  Either my eyes can''t see an ''abstract picture'' here (maid/cow) or there isn''t one (apologies if there is), so, Criticism;  if you have used a dropper or something to create that pattern, if you could have made something looking like a cow (not easy), would have made this a real stand-out shot, in my opinion.</td>', '7 - I like this shot and the ''clean'' and ''sharp feel'' and the style.  Either my eyes can''t see an ''abstract picture'' here (maid/cow) or there isn''t one (apologies if there is), so, Criticism;  if you have used a dropper or something to create that pattern, if you could have made something looking like a cow (not easy), would have made this a real stand-out shot, in my opinion.', '2005-08-25 19:49:41.000000', NULL, 1),
