(1646343, 221662, 42951, '<td valign="top">not a enough color variation for my taste. good idea but maybe a different colored ice cream would have been better. red on red doesnt seem to work to well.</td>', 'not a enough color variation for my taste. good idea but maybe a different colored ice cream would have been better. red on red doesnt seem to work to well.', '2005-08-25 23:10:53.000000', NULL, 1),
