(1646348, 221672, 42951, '<td valign="top">great idea...to bad some of the milk droplets were out of focus. the shadow is cool of the one droplet. i really like the contrast caused the by the difference between the white and black.</td>', 'great idea...to bad some of the milk droplets were out of focus. the shadow is cool of the one droplet. i really like the contrast caused the by the difference between the white and black.', '2005-08-25 23:13:53.000000', NULL, 1),
