(1646485, 219536, 42402, '<td valign="top">Fantastic idea. And it''s a beautiful picture. I like how they''re all different colors following each other in one line. Creative.</td>', 'Fantastic idea. And it''s a beautiful picture. I like how they''re all different colors following each other in one line. Creative.', '2005-08-26 00:16:46.000000', NULL, 1),
