(1647157, 221543, 38924, '<td valign="top">Nice photo.  Just my opinion, but I would like to see the images more centered in the shot.  Either a tighter crop on top or extend the frame down a bit.</td>', 'Nice photo.  Just my opinion, but I would like to see the images more centered in the shot.  Either a tighter crop on top or extend the frame down a bit.', '2005-08-26 10:02:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1647181, 222161, 43115, '<td valign="top">For me, the lack of anything in clear focus is distracting.  I understand abstract, but there should still be a focal point.</td>', 'For me, the lack of anything in clear focus is distracting.  I understand abstract, but there should still be a focal point.', '2005-08-26 10:18:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1647189, 221717, 43115, '<td valign="top">A good shot of childhood bliss.  The red really pops out, but I''m not sure if the green on the left is distracting or good contrast.  I like the duality of the melting ice cream and the fact the kid''s in a zipped up jacket.  Something about the kid''s expression is a little troubling though, like eating the icecream is work, or hard, or something...</td>', 'A good shot of childhood bliss.  The red really pops out, but I''m not sure if the green on the left is distracting or good contrast.  I like the duality of the melting ice cream and the fact the kid''s in a zipped up jacket.  Something about the kid''s expression is a little troubling though, like eating the icecream is work, or hard, or something...', '2005-08-26 10:19:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1647192, 221903, 42100, '<td valign="top">Could use a stronger focal point.  Overhead light pulls eye away!</td>', 'Could use a stronger focal point.  Overhead light pulls eye away!', '2005-08-26 10:20:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1647196, 220384, 42100, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject, but could use a stronger focal point.</td>', 'Interesting subject, but could use a stronger focal point.', '2005-08-26 10:21:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1647200, 221781, 43115, '<td valign="top">I LOVE this one.  The Black and White really adds to the feel of this one... I love the booth cutting through the picture, it effectivley removes distraction and provides great contrast to the black of the windows.<br/>The extra chair is a little unsettling, blocking off the women on the left.  I wonder if the picture would be better off without it, but at the same time, it does add something too.<br/>If this was an advanced editing challenge I would expect that you''d get rid of the horizontal lines in the near booth (what is that, anyway) and the spot of light (flash?) in the window.<br/>Overall GREAT JOB!</td>', 'I LOVE this one.  The Black and White really adds to the feel of this one... I love the booth cutting through the picture, it effectivley removes distraction and provides great contrast to the black of the windows.The extra chair is a little unsettling, blocking off the women on the left.  I wonder if the picture would be better off without it, but at the same time, it does add something too.If this was an advanced editing challenge I would expect that you''d get rid of the horizontal lines in the near booth (what is that, anyway) and the spot of light (flash?) in the window.Overall GREAT JOB!', '2005-08-26 10:23:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1647204, 221561, 43115, '<td valign="top">The red and the white really pop with contrast, but the picture is kinda blah for me.  The scratches in the table distract.  Maybe if the focus was on the chocolate syrup botle?</td>', 'The red and the white really pop with contrast, but the picture is kinda blah for me.  The scratches in the table distract.  Maybe if the focus was on the chocolate syrup botle?', '2005-08-26 10:24:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1647206, 220511, 43115, '<td valign="top">Great stop action shot!</td>', 'Great stop action shot!', '2005-08-26 10:24:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1647289, 220584, 42837, '<td valign="top">Very dark use a flash to bring out the figures. And the viewers focus seems to be drawn towards the door/serving hatch (whatever is there) which unfortunately is cropped out.</td>', 'Very dark use a flash to bring out the figures. And the viewers focus seems to be drawn towards the door/serving hatch (whatever is there) which unfortunately is cropped out.', '2005-08-26 11:16:14.000000', NULL, 1),
