(1647307, 221278, 35739, '<td valign="top">Not to fond of the quality of the image.  The idea is great.  I do not like the background color and appears to be a little out of focus.  The color of the cheese and the background color are to simular.</td>', 'Not to fond of the quality of the image.  The idea is great.  I do not like the background color and appears to be a little out of focus.  The color of the cheese and the background color are to simular.', '2005-08-26 11:31:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1647310, 220901, 35739, '<td valign="top">What is that in front of the bottle?  I assume it is a glass?  I cannot tell.  I like the angle of the photo and the usage of b/w.  Not fond of the glass.</td>', 'What is that in front of the bottle?  I assume it is a glass?  I cannot tell.  I like the angle of the photo and the usage of b/w.  Not fond of the glass.', '2005-08-26 11:33:15.000000', NULL, 1),
