(1647401, 222162, 42837, '<td valign="top">Very witty, and the kitten looks adorable. I love all the elements you used to evoke a frosty impression. A sharper focus on the eyes and whiskers would have helped.</td>', 'Very witty, and the kitten looks adorable. I love all the elements you used to evoke a frosty impression. A sharper focus on the eyes and whiskers would have helped.', '2005-08-26 12:16:49.000000', NULL, 1),
