(1647512, 222157, 22612, '<td valign="top">Very creative- great take on the challenge- 9</td>', 'Very creative- great take on the challenge- 9', '2005-08-26 13:20:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1647514, 222048, 22612, '<td valign="top">This is probably my favorite of the bunch- great shot-10</td>', 'This is probably my favorite of the bunch- great shot-10', '2005-08-26 13:21:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1647521, 220991, 28710, '<td valign="top">I really like the Idea here. but I would have to say that something about the way it was done leaves a little to be desired. I wonder if you could have used macro and shallow depth of field to some effect with the idea of using a sheet.<br/> <br/>I''m sure others will comment on the rest of the issues, such as the lighting on the black curtain and the red cast on the white sheet.<br/> <br/>Well done on actually doing something and entering it, which is better than I could say for myself.</td>', 'I really like the Idea here. but I would have to say that something about the way it was done leaves a little to be desired. I wonder if you could have used macro and shallow depth of field to some effect with the idea of using a sheet. I''m sure others will comment on the rest of the issues, such as the lighting on the black curtain and the red cast on the white sheet. Well done on actually doing something and entering it, which is better than I could say for myself.', '2005-08-26 13:27:39.000000', NULL, 1),
