(1647892, 222030, 42843, '<td valign="top">Glad to see somebody use some balance and composition in their photograph.  I am voting through this contest for the first time and I cannot look at some of these photos.  This however, I like.  White milk, black cookie, good balance, however, could use a little more detail on the right area of the cookie.</td>', 'Glad to see somebody use some balance and composition in their photograph.  I am voting through this contest for the first time and I cannot look at some of these photos.  This however, I like.  White milk, black cookie, good balance, however, could use a little more detail on the right area of the cookie.', '2005-08-26 16:34:13.000000', NULL, 1),
