(1647906, 220401, 17507, '<td valign="top">jesus cheeses!<br/>not sure that the reflections in the glass are helping this image. blocking the direct light with a piece of cardboard is a cheap fix--also, a polarizer would help.</td>', 'jesus cheeses!not sure that the reflections in the glass are helping this image. blocking the direct light with a piece of cardboard is a cheap fix--also, a polarizer would help.', '2005-08-26 16:43:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1647908, 220038, 42843, '<td valign="top">Skyline would look better as a silhouette, but good concept.  Only one I''ve seen like this so far.</td>', 'Skyline would look better as a silhouette, but good concept.  Only one I''ve seen like this so far.', '2005-08-26 16:44:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1647909, 222031, 17507, '<td valign="top">eek. having put chunks of chocolate in cold milk before, I know how poorly they combine, so this makes for a rather unappetizing image--<br/>I like the idea, but what if it were hot milk and you could see the chocolate melting? also, less harsh lighting would flatter your subjects more.</td>', 'eek. having put chunks of chocolate in cold milk before, I know how poorly they combine, so this makes for a rather unappetizing image--I like the idea, but what if it were hot milk and you could see the chocolate melting? also, less harsh lighting would flatter your subjects more.', '2005-08-26 16:45:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1647912, 222168, 42843, '<td valign="top">Subject is kind of weak.  I can''t tell what it is, looks like a turd.</td>', 'Subject is kind of weak.  I can''t tell what it is, looks like a turd.', '2005-08-26 16:46:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1647913, 222048, 17507, '<td valign="top">great shot! I''m undecided about the inclusion of the house in the background, but I understand there may have been little you could do about it--in any case, it''s pretty minor, and the photo is interesting and engaging.</td>', 'great shot! I''m undecided about the inclusion of the house in the background, but I understand there may have been little you could do about it--in any case, it''s pretty minor, and the photo is interesting and engaging.', '2005-08-26 16:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1647915, 222049, 17507, '<td valign="top">great idea and composition, though the focus being on the background seriously detracts from this image... if the focus were correct, this would get at least a 7 from me, but as it is, it''s a 5.</td>', 'great idea and composition, though the focus being on the background seriously detracts from this image... if the focus were correct, this would get at least a 7 from me, but as it is, it''s a 5.', '2005-08-26 16:48:29.000000', NULL, 1),
