(1647939, 222114, 17507, '<td valign="top">a photograph of something that is surely delicious, but compositionally and creatively it is lacking. there is no center of interest, barely even a focal point... why, I ask you, would I want to spend my time looking at this picture? I don''t mean that harshly--it''s just a question that I think every photographer should ask themselves, especially when putting work on public display. I think, <i>would someone else want to have this on their wall?</i> if the answer is no, there generally needs to be a good reason to display it otherwise...</td>', 'a photograph of something that is surely delicious, but compositionally and creatively it is lacking. there is no center of interest, barely even a focal point... why, I ask you, would I want to spend my time looking at this picture? I don''t mean that harshly--it''s just a question that I think every photographer should ask themselves, especially when putting work on public display. I think, would someone else want to have this on their wall? if the answer is no, there generally needs to be a good reason to display it otherwise...', '2005-08-26 17:01:02.000000', NULL, 1),
