(1648088, 222036, 3032, '<td valign="top">The idea is funny, but the background/foreground texture is not helping the photo. It is also a diffucult shot to get right exposure wise, with the bright cat part vs dark reds. <br/>Straightening the horizon so that the glass would look like it stands right up would help as well.</td>', 'The idea is funny, but the background/foreground texture is not helping the photo. It is also a diffucult shot to get right exposure wise, with the bright cat part vs dark reds. Straightening the horizon so that the glass would look like it stands right up would help as well.', '2005-08-26 18:42:43.000000', NULL, 1),
