(1648643, 221565, 22734, '<td valign="top">A wonderful splash but perhaps less cookies may have given this image a sharper edge. Nevertheless, great stop action. Bumping up.</td>', 'A wonderful splash but perhaps less cookies may have given this image a sharper edge. Nevertheless, great stop action. Bumping up.', '2005-08-26 22:55:09.000000', NULL, 1),
