(1648755, 221615, 25678, '<td valign="top">This picture has lots of noise in it.  As a suggestion, try lowering your iso to 100 and using a tripod.  Also, you may want to try neat image or noise ninja in post processing to help reduce the noise</td>', 'This picture has lots of noise in it.  As a suggestion, try lowering your iso to 100 and using a tripod.  Also, you may want to try neat image or noise ninja in post processing to help reduce the noise', '2005-08-27 00:14:43.000000', NULL, 1),
