(1648775, 221643, 25678, '<td valign="top">Nnteresting idea, but technically, the picture has a lot of noise in it.  A lower iso or a run through a noise reduction software will help.  Compoitionally, the chair that isbeing sat on is distracting.  It should either not be completely hidden or more of it showing.</td>', 'Nnteresting idea, but technically, the picture has a lot of noise in it.  A lower iso or a run through a noise reduction software will help.  Compoitionally, the chair that isbeing sat on is distracting.  It should either not be completely hidden or more of it showing.', '2005-08-27 00:22:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1648776, 220285, 25678, '<td valign="top">nice capture.  Seems a tiny bit oversharpened for me</td>', 'nice capture.  Seems a tiny bit oversharpened for me', '2005-08-27 00:22:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1648777, 222080, 6519, '<td valign="top">without the title, there is no way I could have linked this creation to the challenge topic. Lovely bright colors, but I believe this site is about photos, not digital art.</td>', 'without the title, there is no way I could have linked this creation to the challenge topic. Lovely bright colors, but I believe this site is about photos, not digital art.', '2005-08-27 00:23:09.000000', NULL, 1),
