(1648803, 221781, 6519, '<td valign="top">I like snapshots, but this is a bit too "snappy" for my liking. If you had moved over just a little bit, we wouldn''t have half of the pic taken up with the table and backrest of your booth, instead of your subject. <br/>The black and white works well for this shot.</td>', 'I like snapshots, but this is a bit too "snappy" for my liking. If you had moved over just a little bit, we wouldn''t have half of the pic taken up with the table and backrest of your booth, instead of your subject. The black and white works well for this shot.', '2005-08-27 00:34:48.000000', NULL, 1),
