(1649186, 221338, 5112, '<td valign="top">A classic librodo :)  This one is really beautiful, it''s so candid, yet it looks very professional.  You certainly have a beautiful way to bring out the reds/oranges/yellows.  Love the catchlights.  The milk almost looks like yogurt or cream.  I really, really like it that you didn''t smooth her skin, that, in fact, you left the little blemish on her forehead - makes it so much more human.  ~10</td>', 'A classic librodo :)  This one is really beautiful, it''s so candid, yet it looks very professional.  You certainly have a beautiful way to bring out the reds/oranges/yellows.  Love the catchlights.  The milk almost looks like yogurt or cream.  I really, really like it that you didn''t smooth her skin, that, in fact, you left the little blemish on her forehead - makes it so much more human.  ~10', '2005-08-27 03:14:21.000000', NULL, 1),
