(1649380, 221538, 36528, '<td valign="top">Image appears a bit soft overall with no clear subject (except for the help given by the title). I would suggest getting in closer and singling out a subject.</td>', 'Image appears a bit soft overall with no clear subject (except for the help given by the title). I would suggest getting in closer and singling out a subject.', '2005-08-27 09:40:36.000000', NULL, 1),
