(1650034, 221396, 12802, '<td valign="top">Absolutely stunning shot!  I really like this!  There''s some pictures that you see and you immediately like, this is most definately one of them!  <br/> <br/>Your lighting is perfect, the tones in the cream/milk isbrilliant. It has such a smooth feel to it, just what you think of when having strawberry''s and cream!!<br/> <br/>The positioning of the strawberry is spot on too, perfect!  Definately full marks here!!<br/> <br/>A simple looking shot to the eye, there''s little to look at, but again so much!  You see the strawberry, then keep looking at the splash, the droplets, the shadow, the slight reflection, I could go on...<br/> <br/>Very well done, a well deserved 10. (And most probably a nice blue ribbon too)</td>', 'Absolutely stunning shot!  I really like this!  There''s some pictures that you see and you immediately like, this is most definately one of them!   Your lighting is perfect, the tones in the cream/milk isbrilliant. It has such a smooth feel to it, just what you think of when having strawberry''s and cream!! The positioning of the strawberry is spot on too, perfect!  Definately full marks here!! A simple looking shot to the eye, there''s little to look at, but again so much!  You see the strawberry, then keep looking at the splash, the droplets, the shadow, the slight reflection, I could go on... Very well done, a well deserved 10. (And most probably a nice blue ribbon too)', '2005-08-27 16:14:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1650038, 221623, 12802, '<td valign="top">I really like the feel of this shot!<br/> <br/>The grain works well, adds more texture to the shot.  The lighting is great, a good white on the milk.  9</td>', 'I really like the feel of this shot! The grain works well, adds more texture to the shot.  The lighting is great, a good white on the milk.  9', '2005-08-27 16:17:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1650041, 222165, 38452, '<td valign="top">The front of the wheel is out of focus,  being the subject it probably should have been sharp. The plate/cheese is off-center. The colors and choice of background items are well done, and the image has a nice sense of warmth.</td>', 'The front of the wheel is out of focus,  being the subject it probably should have been sharp. The plate/cheese is off-center. The colors and choice of background items are well done, and the image has a nice sense of warmth.', '2005-08-27 16:20:38.000000', NULL, 1),
