(1650193, 220706, 43083, '<td valign="top">my favourite sweet - ice-cream, really nice picture, love the setting you''ve used.</td>', 'my favourite sweet - ice-cream, really nice picture, love the setting you''ve used.', '2005-08-27 17:51:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1650197, 221643, 811, '<td valign="top">Good attempt.<br/> <br/>The picture looks like it was seriously underexposed, then adjusted in post processing resulting in the grainy appearance.  I also think a tighter composition would have made this stronger as well.</td>', 'Good attempt. The picture looks like it was seriously underexposed, then adjusted in post processing resulting in the grainy appearance.  I also think a tighter composition would have made this stronger as well.', '2005-08-27 17:52:58.000000', NULL, 1),
