(1650217, 221558, 20530, '<td valign="top">I thought I''d gotten tired of seeing stuff smeared on peopl''es faces, but this has proven me wrong. That''s pretty wild! The reasons that it works for me are these: The green eyes and red on lips jump out and really make it pop. It''s a good crop, and I like the lighting.</td>', 'I thought I''d gotten tired of seeing stuff smeared on peopl''es faces, but this has proven me wrong. That''s pretty wild! The reasons that it works for me are these: The green eyes and red on lips jump out and really make it pop. It''s a good crop, and I like the lighting.', '2005-08-27 18:06:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1650218, 222133, 43083, '<td valign="top">great idea, love the white against the black.</td>', 'great idea, love the white against the black.', '2005-08-27 18:07:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1650238, 220242, 20530, '<td valign="top">Is that milk that''s been in those bottles all these years? (Sorry for being silly). I''m assuming there''s a reason for the styrofoam bead looking stuff, or is it dried milk? Presumably so the labels will stand out? The bottles are really neat, and I think it would have been worth the sacrifice of liquid milk for the sake of the shot. JMO.</td>', 'Is that milk that''s been in those bottles all these years? (Sorry for being silly). I''m assuming there''s a reason for the styrofoam bead looking stuff, or is it dried milk? Presumably so the labels will stand out? The bottles are really neat, and I think it would have been worth the sacrifice of liquid milk for the sake of the shot. JMO.', '2005-08-27 18:16:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1650241, 221430, 20530, '<td valign="top">Nice use of complementary colors and good, sharp focus. Wish I could get that kind of cheese here!</td>', 'Nice use of complementary colors and good, sharp focus. Wish I could get that kind of cheese here!', '2005-08-27 18:17:56.000000', NULL, 1),
