(1650663, 221703, 43115, '<td valign="top">The only way to improve this photo might have been to catch the milk stream when it was first starting, and half way down the model''s back... instead of the puddle.<br/>Very well done overall.</td>', 'The only way to improve this photo might have been to catch the milk stream when it was first starting, and half way down the model''s back... instead of the puddle.Very well done overall.', '2005-08-27 21:56:13.000000', NULL, 1),
