(1651713, 221347, 20530, '<td valign="top">Good light. The background is nice, and I just love the "expressions" cattle make. A few things would make it even better to me: The composition is good; although, I think a little more of the bottom of frame would give it more balance. There''s a perceived "chopping" of the calf''s feet. Mom''s face is a little OOF. It would have even been better if you could have gotten a shot without the ears of that other cow behind her head.<br/> <br/>That''s just my nit-picking, because I really do like this one.</td>', 'Good light. The background is nice, and I just love the "expressions" cattle make. A few things would make it even better to me: The composition is good; although, I think a little more of the bottom of frame would give it more balance. There''s a perceived "chopping" of the calf''s feet. Mom''s face is a little OOF. It would have even been better if you could have gotten a shot without the ears of that other cow behind her head. That''s just my nit-picking, because I really do like this one.', '2005-08-28 13:23:44.000000', NULL, 1),
