(1652788, 221620, 38476, '<td valign="top">Great setup (with all the cows looking your way), catchy title, &amp; a nice touch that your camera''s at the same height as the cow''s eyes. The B&amp;W, however, makes it a little harder to identify heads &amp; bodies at a glance.</td>', 'Great setup (with all the cows looking your way), catchy title, & a nice touch that your camera''s at the same height as the cow''s eyes. The B&W, however, makes it a little harder to identify heads & bodies at a glance.', '2005-08-28 22:28:03.000000', NULL, 1),
