(1653907, 222033, 6132, '<td valign="top">A great expression and capture that you''ve caught. Lighting seems almost spot on, the colours of the carton add a touch of boldness to the image. I''m unsure about the background though, is it light from a doorway or the back of a chair or something? It might have looked more dynamic with just a plain black background...just a suggestion :) Overall I really do like the image and can see it doing well. Good luck!</td>', 'A great expression and capture that you''ve caught. Lighting seems almost spot on, the colours of the carton add a touch of boldness to the image. I''m unsure about the background though, is it light from a doorway or the back of a chair or something? It might have looked more dynamic with just a plain black background...just a suggestion :) Overall I really do like the image and can see it doing well. Good luck!', '2005-08-29 07:23:33.000000', NULL, 1),
