(1657920, 221558, 34247, '<td valign="top">nice eyes and color use.</td>', 'nice eyes and color use.', '2005-08-30 14:00:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1657984, 220992, 40912, '<td valign="top">I like this but the dark in the background is a little distracting.</td>', 'I like this but the dark in the background is a little distracting.', '2005-08-30 14:27:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1657987, 219683, 40912, '<td valign="top">Nice pic.... dairy?</td>', 'Nice pic.... dairy?', '2005-08-30 14:28:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1658002, 219987, 40912, '<td valign="top">This reminds me of mornings when  nice, quiet, long mornings where hot tea, fresh bread, rich cheese, and fresh lemon curd were all that mattered. Yeah, I know this comment doesn''t really help much. But I just really like what this image evokes for me. :) The mousetrap is a neat idea also... it can be looked at in a number of ways. Shadows and lighting are perfect, IMO. :) I gave this a 9.</td>', 'This reminds me of mornings when  nice, quiet, long mornings where hot tea, fresh bread, rich cheese, and fresh lemon curd were all that mattered. Yeah, I know this comment doesn''t really help much. But I just really like what this image evokes for me. :) The mousetrap is a neat idea also... it can be looked at in a number of ways. Shadows and lighting are perfect, IMO. :) I gave this a 9.', '2005-08-30 14:37:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1658006, 222138, 40912, '<td valign="top">I like the angle, but the face is out of focus.. looks like the camera focused on the fence. Makes me think more of steak than milk, lol. :)</td>', 'I like the angle, but the face is out of focus.. looks like the camera focused on the fence. Makes me think more of steak than milk, lol. :)', '2005-08-30 14:39:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1658014, 222080, 40912, '<td valign="top">Neat idea, but a little too busy for me. I think that the original would have been nicer. :)</td>', 'Neat idea, but a little too busy for me. I think that the original would have been nicer. :)', '2005-08-30 14:40:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1658018, 221925, 40912, '<td valign="top">Love the grainy look, and the way the milk mixed with the coffee. Very well done. :)</td>', 'Love the grainy look, and the way the milk mixed with the coffee. Very well done. :)', '2005-08-30 14:41:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1658026, 222056, 40912, '<td valign="top">I''m not a huge fan of the ''Got Milk'' things, because to me the milk on the lip never looks real.. looks like of like glue.. <br/>That said, I do think this is a good picture.. her eyes are in-focus and lovely. :)</td>', 'I''m not a huge fan of the ''Got Milk'' things, because to me the milk on the lip never looks real.. looks like of like glue.. That said, I do think this is a good picture.. her eyes are in-focus and lovely. :)', '2005-08-30 14:43:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1658030, 222157, 41920, '<td valign="top">AAA+ great Ideal</td>', 'AAA+ great Ideal', '2005-08-30 14:44:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1658031, 222069, 40912, '<td valign="top">A little dark.. I like the grainy look but it would be nice to see the plate/bowl of cherries a little better.</td>', 'A little dark.. I like the grainy look but it would be nice to see the plate/bowl of cherries a little better.', '2005-08-30 14:44:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1658036, 222140, 41920, '<td valign="top">Wheres the Milk?</td>', 'Wheres the Milk?', '2005-08-30 14:46:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1658039, 220401, 40912, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of my younger days.. I love this image - very well done. :)  I do think that maybe the plant in the background distracts a bit, but if it was gone, the image would be missing something.  I gave this a 9.</td>', 'Reminds me of my younger days.. I love this image - very well done. :)  I do think that maybe the plant in the background distracts a bit, but if it was gone, the image would be missing something.  I gave this a 9.', '2005-08-30 14:47:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1658046, 220441, 40912, '<td valign="top">Nice capture. How many times did you have to overflow the glass before getting this shot? :)</td>', 'Nice capture. How many times did you have to overflow the glass before getting this shot? :)', '2005-08-30 14:48:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1658049, 220376, 40912, '<td valign="top">I love these type of shots, though I think this is a little too blurry.</td>', 'I love these type of shots, though I think this is a little too blurry.', '2005-08-30 14:49:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1658058, 221340, 40912, '<td valign="top">I love this image, but the rainbow in the window in the reflection distracts me for some reason.. Sorry for being nitpicky! I gave it a 7... that toast is making me hungry, lol.</td>', 'I love this image, but the rainbow in the window in the reflection distracts me for some reason.. Sorry for being nitpicky! I gave it a 7... that toast is making me hungry, lol.', '2005-08-30 14:50:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1658061, 220901, 40912, '<td valign="top">The brightness of the glass at the bottom is a little overwhelming, but otherwise I really like this. :)</td>', 'The brightness of the glass at the bottom is a little overwhelming, but otherwise I really like this. :)', '2005-08-30 14:51:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1658070, 221387, 40912, '<td valign="top">I don''t really like most of the shots with cats and milk, but this one is excellent. It kinda gives me the feeling that the kitty was caught sneaking the milk.. Wonderful shot. :)</td>', 'I don''t really like most of the shots with cats and milk, but this one is excellent. It kinda gives me the feeling that the kitty was caught sneaking the milk.. Wonderful shot. :)', '2005-08-30 14:53:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1658076, 222117, 40912, '<td valign="top">Original idea. :) The milk doesn''t really look like it''s coming from the class, but from under it. That''s my only issue with this. I like it otherwise. :)</td>', 'Original idea. :) The milk doesn''t really look like it''s coming from the class, but from under it. That''s my only issue with this. I like it otherwise. :)', '2005-08-30 14:54:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1658077, 222062, 39833, '<td valign="top">nice, high key shot.</td>', 'nice, high key shot.', '2005-08-30 14:54:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1658079, 222062, 40912, '<td valign="top">Nice shot of the coffee but I think there''s just a little too much white..</td>', 'Nice shot of the coffee but I think there''s just a little too much white..', '2005-08-30 14:55:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1658084, 220511, 40912, '<td valign="top">Love this shot, though if the cookie was a little bit sharper I think it would help the image.</td>', 'Love this shot, though if the cookie was a little bit sharper I think it would help the image.', '2005-08-30 14:56:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1658086, 221971, 40912, '<td valign="top">Cute.. nice idea. :)</td>', 'Cute.. nice idea. :)', '2005-08-30 14:56:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1658113, 222011, 40912, '<td valign="top">The idea is fun, but a few things take away from this for me.. the fingernails with scraped and chipped red polish, the fact that the hands aren''t sharply focused.. and the grass in the back that''s in-focus, while the grass in front is blurry.</td>', 'The idea is fun, but a few things take away from this for me.. the fingernails with scraped and chipped red polish, the fact that the hands aren''t sharply focused.. and the grass in the back that''s in-focus, while the grass in front is blurry.', '2005-08-30 15:02:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1658117, 222048, 40912, '<td valign="top">I don''t really like most of the cow submissions... but this one is great. The look in the eyes of the front cow is hilarious. :)</td>', 'I don''t really like most of the cow submissions... but this one is great. The look in the eyes of the front cow is hilarious. :)', '2005-08-30 15:03:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1658122, 222034, 20056, '<td valign="top">Nice idea...</td>', 'Nice idea...', '2005-08-30 15:04:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1658130, 220518, 30605, '<td valign="top">Very good idea; came out pretty nicely.</td>', 'Very good idea; came out pretty nicely.', '2005-08-30 15:05:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1658131, 222081, 40912, '<td valign="top">Is that milk running down her stomach? Can''t quite figure it out.. not super crazy about this one, and it all looks slightly blurry.</td>', 'Is that milk running down her stomach? Can''t quite figure it out.. not super crazy about this one, and it all looks slightly blurry.', '2005-08-30 15:05:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1658133, 221931, 40912, '<td valign="top">Too blurry.. and the tablecloth is distracting.</td>', 'Too blurry.. and the tablecloth is distracting.', '2005-08-30 15:05:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1658135, 221980, 30605, '<td valign="top">Image is a bit flat. Lacks some light or contrast I am not sure. Original idea.</td>', 'Image is a bit flat. Lacks some light or contrast I am not sure. Original idea.', '2005-08-30 15:06:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1658145, 222068, 30605, '<td valign="top">Good composition. Unusual background color for a milk shot. Very contrasty. Glass is a bit dirty, it rob your image of the final touch. How many cookies have you dip and eat before shooting this one :) ?</td>', 'Good composition. Unusual background color for a milk shot. Very contrasty. Glass is a bit dirty, it rob your image of the final touch. How many cookies have you dip and eat before shooting this one :) ?', '2005-08-30 15:08:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1658146, 222022, 30605, '<td valign="top">That cerntainly makes me hungry.</td>', 'That cerntainly makes me hungry.', '2005-08-30 15:09:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1658151, 220313, 43412, '<td valign="top">Very sharp. Nice.</td>', 'Very sharp. Nice.', '2005-08-30 15:10:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1658163, 220998, 30605, '<td valign="top">A bit more light would have helped; the milk look almost grey. Otherwise, that a good composition.</td>', 'A bit more light would have helped; the milk look almost grey. Otherwise, that a good composition.', '2005-08-30 15:13:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1658171, 222061, 30605, '<td valign="top">Now I am really hungry. Good composition and I like the shallow depth of field.</td>', 'Now I am really hungry. Good composition and I like the shallow depth of field.', '2005-08-30 15:14:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1658172, 221264, 40912, '<td valign="top">This image is blurry in random spots and focused mostly on the one nipple. Her lips are extremely red and she looks pissed off about something... Sorry, I didn''t like this one much.</td>', 'This image is blurry in random spots and focused mostly on the one nipple. Her lips are extremely red and she looks pissed off about something... Sorry, I didn''t like this one much.', '2005-08-30 15:14:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1658173, 221562, 40912, '<td valign="top">Haha.. thoughtful and cute. :)</td>', 'Haha.. thoughtful and cute. :)', '2005-08-30 15:14:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1658175, 222136, 29148, '<td valign="top">Innovative title</td>', 'Innovative title', '2005-08-30 15:15:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1658180, 221730, 40912, '<td valign="top">Pretty scenery, but the shadow caused by the cloud draws all my attention. Not to be picky, but the typo in the title throws me a little too..</td>', 'Pretty scenery, but the shadow caused by the cloud draws all my attention. Not to be picky, but the typo in the title throws me a little too..', '2005-08-30 15:16:37.000000', NULL, 1),
