(1658198, 221857, 40912, '<td valign="top">While it''s all a little blurred, I think the milk on the outside of the glass is really neat.</td>', 'While it''s all a little blurred, I think the milk on the outside of the glass is really neat.', '2005-08-30 15:19:59.000000', NULL, 1),
