(1658450, 219249, 17507, '<td valign="top">the title seems to want to tell a story, which I like - but I feel like there''s a piece of it missing and so I wind up just wondering what your reasons were for calling it what you did.</td>', 'the title seems to want to tell a story, which I like - but I feel like there''s a piece of it missing and so I wind up just wondering what your reasons were for calling it what you did.', '2005-08-30 16:48:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1658456, 221407, 17507, '<td valign="top">nice framing- I usually don''t go for heavy or double borders, but it works here. I might have wanted the outside border just a wee bit darker. minor nitpicking tho. the texture of the ice cream is very good- you must have worked quickly to take this picture without any evidence of melting!</td>', 'nice framing- I usually don''t go for heavy or double borders, but it works here. I might have wanted the outside border just a wee bit darker. minor nitpicking tho. the texture of the ice cream is very good- you must have worked quickly to take this picture without any evidence of melting!', '2005-08-30 16:50:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1658461, 222154, 17507, '<td valign="top">lol. maybe we should be asking what its half-life is :)<br/>the glow is very nice, bright without being too close to white. the red halo at the bottom adds interest. compositionally, I think you could have cropped off some of the space on the right--remember the rule of thirds, which is particularly applicable to this kind of simple and uncluttered composition.</td>', 'lol. maybe we should be asking what its half-life is :)the glow is very nice, bright without being too close to white. the red halo at the bottom adds interest. compositionally, I think you could have cropped off some of the space on the right--remember the rule of thirds, which is particularly applicable to this kind of simple and uncluttered composition.', '2005-08-30 16:51:42.000000', NULL, 1),
