(1658483, 222059, 17507, '<td valign="top">lighting is very appealing. reflections on the glass are distracting, but without a polarizer, there''s not much that can be done. the different levels of liquid in the glasses provide a nice sense of motion in this picture. I''d have liked to see a bit more milk in the leftmost glass. good work, anyway... I hope the final score is over 6.</td>', 'lighting is very appealing. reflections on the glass are distracting, but without a polarizer, there''s not much that can be done. the different levels of liquid in the glasses provide a nice sense of motion in this picture. I''d have liked to see a bit more milk in the leftmost glass. good work, anyway... I hope the final score is over 6.', '2005-08-30 16:56:23.000000', NULL, 1),
