(1659001, 222157, 43298, '<td valign="top">Clever!</td>', 'Clever!', '2005-08-30 19:36:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1659010, 222048, 30817, '<td valign="top">What a great merger of creative thinking, accomplished framing and excellent use of equipment!  Everything about this shot sings to me of craftmanship.  Apart from its obvious humorous leanings, this photograph expresses your theme perfectly with inclusion of the distant farm buildings and the vast pastures.  One of my top ten picks for the challenge.</td>', 'What a great merger of creative thinking, accomplished framing and excellent use of equipment!  Everything about this shot sings to me of craftmanship.  Apart from its obvious humorous leanings, this photograph expresses your theme perfectly with inclusion of the distant farm buildings and the vast pastures.  One of my top ten picks for the challenge.', '2005-08-30 19:42:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1659068, 220271, 30817, '<td valign="top">This is an extremely stylish still life.  The inclusion of the living greenery in the BG is a wonderful touch.  Good use of limited DOF to delineate the cheese as the main subject and avoid busy confusion.  While on first glance there appeared to be an unwanted highlight of yellow on the plant (easily remedied with spot editing not allowed here), after looking at it, I thought of it as an accent mark over the cheese.  With or without the "accent", this is superb and one of my picks to ribbon.  Well done!</td>', 'This is an extremely stylish still life.  The inclusion of the living greenery in the BG is a wonderful touch.  Good use of limited DOF to delineate the cheese as the main subject and avoid busy confusion.  While on first glance there appeared to be an unwanted highlight of yellow on the plant (easily remedied with spot editing not allowed here), after looking at it, I thought of it as an accent mark over the cheese.  With or without the "accent", this is superb and one of my picks to ribbon.  Well done!', '2005-08-30 20:10:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1659074, 221972, 30817, '<td valign="top">You actually managed to scare me with a dairy product!  Not easy to do.  This is a superior composition and the illusion of selective desat is a terrific touch.  Your skilled eye for detail, lighting and framing is evident in this shot.  Wonderful work and one of my picks to ribbon.</td>', 'You actually managed to scare me with a dairy product!  Not easy to do.  This is a superior composition and the illusion of selective desat is a terrific touch.  Your skilled eye for detail, lighting and framing is evident in this shot.  Wonderful work and one of my picks to ribbon.', '2005-08-30 20:14:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1659100, 221513, 36908, '<td valign="top">Love this picture.  The capture of the sp;ash is awesome...good capture</td>', 'Love this picture.  The capture of the sp;ash is awesome...good capture', '2005-08-30 20:23:51.000000', NULL, 1),
