(1659115, 220697, 30817, '<td valign="top">This is my winner for the challenge!  The best of them all.  This is not only classy in appearance, but speaks to the theme.  There is not only the representation of an iced dairy product, but also the swirling suggestion as to its liquid origins (complete with suggested "drip") and the mixing motion that helped produce it.  I love the repeated whorls in the base of the glass container as well.  Adding this to my favorites as a reminder of an outstanding challenge entry.</td>', 'This is my winner for the challenge!  The best of them all.  This is not only classy in appearance, but speaks to the theme.  There is not only the representation of an iced dairy product, but also the swirling suggestion as to its liquid origins (complete with suggested "drip") and the mixing motion that helped produce it.  I love the repeated whorls in the base of the glass container as well.  Adding this to my favorites as a reminder of an outstanding challenge entry.', '2005-08-30 20:31:11.000000', NULL, 1),
