(1659216, 221620, 30364, '<td valign="top">Ha!  Love this ... it''s a terrific capture to have seen and photographed three such similar ladies so effectively.  Contrary to what most people would imagine, it''s quite unusual for this level of similarity of markings, especially together.  You certainly made the most of the opportunity!  8</td>', 'Ha!  Love this ... it''s a terrific capture to have seen and photographed three such similar ladies so effectively.  Contrary to what most people would imagine, it''s quite unusual for this level of similarity of markings, especially together.  You certainly made the most of the opportunity!  8', '2005-08-30 21:01:15.000000', NULL, 1),
