(1659240, 221541, 30364, '<td valign="top">It''s very appealing; a pretty model with perfect skin, hair &amp; eyes for your idea, great little details (the white background/top lip/straps), slightly off-centre composition &amp; asymmetrical shoulder level creates just a tiny hint of tension, and the understated presence of the milk puts emphasis where it should be (on the charming model) without weakening the overall Dairy theme of the shot.  9</td>', 'It''s very appealing; a pretty model with perfect skin, hair & eyes for your idea, great little details (the white background/top lip/straps), slightly off-centre composition & asymmetrical shoulder level creates just a tiny hint of tension, and the understated presence of the milk puts emphasis where it should be (on the charming model) without weakening the overall Dairy theme of the shot.  9', '2005-08-30 21:08:30.000000', NULL, 1),
