(1659265, 221781, 30364, '<td valign="top">I love this unusual composition.  You perhaps chose this point-of-view mainly to be discrete, but I think you should claim to have done it deliberately because it makes for a fascinating image with a lot of artistic merit.  There will be those who protest that the foreground booth, the chair, the window frames, etc are distracting.  Take no notice whatsoever!  9</td>', 'I love this unusual composition.  You perhaps chose this point-of-view mainly to be discrete, but I think you should claim to have done it deliberately because it makes for a fascinating image with a lot of artistic merit.  There will be those who protest that the foreground booth, the chair, the window frames, etc are distracting.  Take no notice whatsoever!  9', '2005-08-30 21:16:59.000000', NULL, 1),
