(1659307, 219683, 30364, '<td valign="top">Brilliant.  I''ve rated 115 images so far, and they are, with just two exceptions, absolutely dreadful.  My own included, now that I look at it again.  So not only do I not care that you haven''t met the challenge, I actually welcome it.  In fact I applaud it: BRAVO!  9 (Had to deduct a point ... after all, you haven''t met the challenge)</td>', 'Brilliant.  I''ve rated 115 images so far, and they are, with just two exceptions, absolutely dreadful.  My own included, now that I look at it again.  So not only do I not care that you haven''t met the challenge, I actually welcome it.  In fact I applaud it: BRAVO!  9 (Had to deduct a point ... after all, you haven''t met the challenge)', '2005-08-30 21:24:39.000000', NULL, 1),
