(1660216, 222157, 22734, '<td valign="top">Perhaps one of the most outstanding abstract and puzzle image in the realm of DPC. It is an abstract because its appearance lays out the main patches of black and white. The puzzle comes in its inversion to yield to the patient viewer the bosom of its essence. You must look twice, once in abstract (as is) and again in the inverted form.<br/> <br/>Shannon: this shall be a very much discussed image because many viewers did not come back for the second look. And when they get it they will wonder how they ever missed it. You have my full respect.<br/> <br/>Congratulations on your 7th finish.</td>', 'Perhaps one of the most outstanding abstract and puzzle image in the realm of DPC. It is an abstract because its appearance lays out the main patches of black and white. The puzzle comes in its inversion to yield to the patient viewer the bosom of its essence. You must look twice, once in abstract (as is) and again in the inverted form. Shannon: this shall be a very much discussed image because many viewers did not come back for the second look. And when they get it they will wonder how they ever missed it. You have my full respect. Congratulations on your 7th finish.', '2005-08-31 01:26:32.000000', NULL, 0),
