(1660573, 221954, 40081, '<td valign="top">Thank you all for your very helpfull and nice comments. I wish I could have shared some of this ice cream with you all.<br/>Indeed the prime focus is on the bucket. I was just playing around with a diafragma of F/1.4 which is quite unforgiving. By the time I saw the picture on the screen, the ice cream was already all scooped away, and there was no second chance.<br/>My first picture getting a score over 5, which was my short term goal. Although not a spectacular progress, I am quite happy there is progress. I guess I will have to invest a bit more time in the future trying to keep up this level or preferably to improve.</td>', 'Thank you all for your very helpfull and nice comments. I wish I could have shared some of this ice cream with you all.Indeed the prime focus is on the bucket. I was just playing around with a diafragma of F/1.4 which is quite unforgiving. By the time I saw the picture on the screen, the ice cream was already all scooped away, and there was no second chance.My first picture getting a score over 5, which was my short term goal. Although not a spectacular progress, I am quite happy there is progress. I guess I will have to invest a bit more time in the future trying to keep up this level or preferably to improve.', '2005-08-31 02:54:20.000000', NULL, 0);
