(1660685, 222169, 18073, '<td valign="top">Well done on your top 10 finish, but I personally think its worthy of a top 3 finish.  This photo is IMO the most original and well executed of the challenge and deservers a much better placing.  The only (slight) draw back is that the cat looks a little soft, but not enough to detract over all.  Great effort 9/10<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-08-31 07:32:48.</i></td>', 'Well done on your top 10 finish, but I personally think its worthy of a top 3 finish.  This photo is IMO the most original and well executed of the challenge and deservers a much better placing.  The only (slight) draw back is that the cat looks a little soft, but not enough to detract over all.  Great effort 9/10', '2005-08-31 04:14:34.000000', '2005-08-31 08:32:48.000000', 0),
