(1660750, 222117, 37334, '<td valign="top">This was one of my favourites; yes there were many spilt milk images, but this one has something speecial.</td>', 'This was one of my favourites; yes there were many spilt milk images, but this one has something speecial.', '2005-08-31 05:10:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(1660751, 219955, 41548, '<td valign="top">Thank you all for your comments.<br/>For those who don''t know: Cows also have horns. Really!</td>', 'Thank you all for your comments.For those who don''t know: Cows also have horns. Really!', '2005-08-31 05:10:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(1660753, 221427, 37722, '<td valign="top">Thanks for your comments guys, I realy apreciate it.<br/> <br/>In retrospect I''m pretty pleased with this even if it scored badly.  I''m still a newbe and I think I''ve learned a lot, particularly that I''m realy **** at lighting; something that would have improved this picture a lot.<br/> <br/>Clearly the thing to work on is lighting, particularly to bring out contrast and focus the eye on a specific item.  Perhaps a different take would be for light reflected of the knife to light up Gruyere, maybe I''ll experiment.  Any excuse to buy more cheese ;-)</td>', 'Thanks for your comments guys, I realy apreciate it. In retrospect I''m pretty pleased with this even if it scored badly.  I''m still a newbe and I think I''ve learned a lot, particularly that I''m realy **** at lighting; something that would have improved this picture a lot. Clearly the thing to work on is lighting, particularly to bring out contrast and focus the eye on a specific item.  Perhaps a different take would be for light reflected of the knife to light up Gruyere, maybe I''ll experiment.  Any excuse to buy more cheese ;-)', '2005-08-31 05:11:36.000000', NULL, 0),
