(1660915, 222157, 35357, '<td valign="top">I didn''t vote in this challenge, but I wonder how many voters clicked looked at your shot without really seeing it.  I thing you went out on a limb with the abstract cow, and luckily most people got it.  Wonderfully creative!  If I had the brain-power to come up with something like this, I would have made it much more obvious, and doubtlessly ruined it.  Should have placed higher, IMO, but you can''t always cater to the low IQ folks such as myself. :-(  Congrats on the top ten though!</td>', 'I didn''t vote in this challenge, but I wonder how many voters clicked looked at your shot without really seeing it.  I thing you went out on a limb with the abstract cow, and luckily most people got it.  Wonderfully creative!  If I had the brain-power to come up with something like this, I would have made it much more obvious, and doubtlessly ruined it.  Should have placed higher, IMO, but you can''t always cater to the low IQ folks such as myself. :-(  Congrats on the top ten though!', '2005-08-31 07:54:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(1660917, 222169, 35357, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the topo ten, I like it much more than a lot of the shots that placed higher.  Wonderfully-composed B&amp;W!  Refreshing &amp; creative!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-08-31 06:57:50.</i></td>', 'Congrats on the topo ten, I like it much more than a lot of the shots that placed higher.  Wonderfully-composed B&W!  Refreshing & creative!', '2005-08-31 07:57:30.000000', '2005-08-31 07:57:50.000000', 0),
