(1660921, 222084, 34192, '<td valign="top">unbelievable.  The voters score strawberry splashes high and kittens high (tons of them no less) and leave you here?  For what its worth, I gave you a 9.  They couldn''t have been rating you on photo quality so it had to be lack of sense of humor.  I''ll bet 75% of the people voting didn''t even really bother to look.  With the results of this challenge, I think you may be on to something.  I''m very sorry for your loss.  ;)</td>', 'unbelievable.  The voters score strawberry splashes high and kittens high (tons of them no less) and leave you here?  For what its worth, I gave you a 9.  They couldn''t have been rating you on photo quality so it had to be lack of sense of humor.  I''ll bet 75% of the people voting didn''t even really bother to look.  With the results of this challenge, I think you may be on to something.  I''m very sorry for your loss.  ;)', '2005-08-31 08:01:13.000000', NULL, 0),
