(1660955, 222084, 35357, '<td valign="top">Of course I love the shot, made me laugh my buttox off!  Unfortunately, I think the humour was lost on a lot of voters who don''t frequent the forums, so the whole "Show us your Slippy" thing, and other references were lost on the poor folks.  Another fly in the ointment could have been that a lot of people may have thought I did the shot, and in the previouis challenge I probably made a fair number of people angry with my "DNMC" &amp; "wet flowers aren''t interesting" comments, so you may have been voted down for spite as well.  Well, at least we know there are ten intelligent people voting at DPC, the rest are fvcktards!  :-)<br/> <br/>Thanks for doing this shot, I laughed A LOT for a LONG TIME!</td>', 'Of course I love the shot, made me laugh my buttox off!  Unfortunately, I think the humour was lost on a lot of voters who don''t frequent the forums, so the whole "Show us your Slippy" thing, and other references were lost on the poor folks.  Another fly in the ointment could have been that a lot of people may have thought I did the shot, and in the previouis challenge I probably made a fair number of people angry with my "DNMC" & "wet flowers aren''t interesting" comments, so you may have been voted down for spite as well.  Well, at least we know there are ten intelligent people voting at DPC, the rest are fvcktards!  :-) Thanks for doing this shot, I laughed A LOT for a LONG TIME!', '2005-08-31 08:16:34.000000', NULL, 0),
