(1661191, 220518, 37005, '<td valign="top">Wow.  Looking at it in retrospect I think I should''ve scored this higher.  My apologies--as really stylistically this beats all the cows hands down.  Maybe because I was getting so used to the bovines &amp; glass bottles (all obvious) I didn''t realize the milk as backdrop.<br/> <br/>Either way, this is a beautifully done photograph.  If I could''ve gotten through all the dairies this time around I may have come across this again and upped the anty.  My apologies that I didn''t give you at least an 8 or 9.</td>', 'Wow.  Looking at it in retrospect I think I should''ve scored this higher.  My apologies--as really stylistically this beats all the cows hands down.  Maybe because I was getting so used to the bovines & glass bottles (all obvious) I didn''t realize the milk as backdrop. Either way, this is a beautifully done photograph.  If I could''ve gotten through all the dairies this time around I may have come across this again and upped the anty.  My apologies that I didn''t give you at least an 8 or 9.', '2005-08-31 09:54:19.000000', NULL, 0),
