(1661561, 221430, 30817, '<td valign="top">Heck, I don''t know, Bear ... perhaps you should of just thown it all in a big pot of milk and submitted the impact crater.  Yeah... that''s it!  And.. and.. and then the resulting "wall" of milk will look like a crown coming out of the liquid ... with .. with lots of little drips on top of the "spikes" .. and.. and that would look really cool!  I know its my idea .... but it''s OK if you use it.  Just act like you thought of it.</td>', 'Heck, I don''t know, Bear ... perhaps you should of just thown it all in a big pot of milk and submitted the impact crater.  Yeah... that''s it!  And.. and.. and then the resulting "wall" of milk will look like a crown coming out of the liquid ... with .. with lots of little drips on top of the "spikes" .. and.. and that would look really cool!  I know its my idea .... but it''s OK if you use it.  Just act like you thought of it.', '2005-08-31 11:41:00.000000', NULL, 0),
