(1661871, 222157, 16230, '<td valign="top">Well done Shannon! A very original idea for the subject, the composition is good, and using the Elmer''s glue was simply brilliant. BTW, I saw the cow right off.<br/> <br/>I agree with you that the lighting could have been a little better. Is that an octagonal softbox reflecting in the bottle?<br/> <br/>Anyway, your entry is the only one that I felt compelled to comment on. Congrats on the top-ten finish! It could easily have been a ribbon winner.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-08-31 12:07:08.</i></td>', 'Well done Shannon! A very original idea for the subject, the composition is good, and using the Elmer''s glue was simply brilliant. BTW, I saw the cow right off. I agree with you that the lighting could have been a little better. Is that an octagonal softbox reflecting in the bottle? Anyway, your entry is the only one that I felt compelled to comment on. Congrats on the top-ten finish! It could easily have been a ribbon winner.', '2005-08-31 13:05:49.000000', '2005-08-31 13:07:08.000000', 0),
(1661924, 221112, 37719, '<td valign="top">The name ''Spiro'' is an inside joke in my family.  In my mind I saw Spiro pushing my little sister and her dropping her ice cream cone.  Then she gets up and runs inside screaming for mommy.  Funny too, I see this clearly, but it is at the house my grandparents lived in when we were children and lived on Long Island.<br/> <br/>Thank you all for the comments.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-08-31 12:19:04.</i></td>', 'The name ''Spiro'' is an inside joke in my family.  In my mind I saw Spiro pushing my little sister and her dropping her ice cream cone.  Then she gets up and runs inside screaming for mommy.  Funny too, I see this clearly, but it is at the house my grandparents lived in when we were children and lived on Long Island. Thank you all for the comments.', '2005-08-31 13:17:53.000000', '2005-08-31 13:19:04.000000', 0),
(1661946, 220038, 32767, '<td valign="top">Now if you had taken that image from an angle at 60th Street (instead of of 55th/56th) the chunk missing from the moon would have looked much more authentic.<br/> <br/>So this doesn''t really meet the Challenge.<br/> <br/>....Juuuuuust kidding.<br/> <br/>Nice shot.</td>', 'Now if you had taken that image from an angle at 60th Street (instead of of 55th/56th) the chunk missing from the moon would have looked much more authentic. So this doesn''t really meet the Challenge. ....Juuuuuust kidding. Nice shot.', '2005-08-31 13:22:38.000000', NULL, 0),
