(1668631, 221768, 14614, '<td valign="top">Didn''t get a chance to vote this challenge.  I would have given this an 8 - 9.  You''re doing great work in B&amp;W and repeating lines -- this is an example of your fine work.  Leading lines that give us a hint of "cow" just enough but nothing more.  Repetative patters and contrast in textures add interest.  Nicely done. (just now read the other comments and I see I''m not alone in what works!)</td>', 'Didn''t get a chance to vote this challenge.  I would have given this an 8 - 9.  You''re doing great work in B&W and repeating lines -- this is an example of your fine work.  Leading lines that give us a hint of "cow" just enough but nothing more.  Repetative patters and contrast in textures add interest.  Nicely done. (just now read the other comments and I see I''m not alone in what works!)', '2005-09-02 10:36:11.000000', NULL, 0),
